WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.630
A defect is noticed, but the information does not get through?

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:07.750
iqFleetSync™ takes the information from the driver to the workshop at once.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.490
The admin creates the company and invites drivers

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.150
and maintenance in a few minutes.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.740
Add a vehicle, trailer or work machine by registration number.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.430
Print a QR sticker for the unit and fix it in the cab.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:10.650
The driver scans the code and reports the defect straight from the phone.

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:35.110
The workshop gets the notice at once and acknowledges the defect as seen,

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.660
so the driver knows the matter is being handled.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:54.070
The unit is taken into work, the job is marked done

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:56.750
and the unit is roadworthy again.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:20.330
Do you use a partner workshop? Share the units with the workshop,

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.550
so the jobs the workshop does and the parts it replaces

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:27.600
show directly in the unit’s service history.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:39.980
iqFleetSync™ – your fleet is in order, the information gets through.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:43.490
Suits transport companies and workshops.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:48.980
